` endpoint but receives 404 "Not Found" errors\n- Response contains BOM character (`\\ufeff`) suggesting encoding/format issues\n- Affects user experience in the Generated Files UI section\n\n## Milestone Structure\n\n### Milestone 1: Root Cause Analysis & Backend Fix\n**Duration**: 1-2 hours\n**Objective**: Identify and fix the backend issue causing 404 errors\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Root cause analysis document\n- Backend endpoint fix (main.py)\n- Backend server validation\n- Activity tracker integration verification\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Backend server starts successfully on port 8001\n- `/api/activity/files` endpoint responds with 200 OK (not 404)\n- Endpoint returns valid JSON without BOM characters\n- Manual curl test passes: `curl http://localhost:8001/api/activity/files`\n\n**Key Tasks**:\n- Investigate backend server startup and endpoint registration\n- Check activity tracker database connectivity\n- Verify FastAPI route definition and handler function\n- Test endpoint manually via curl\n- Fix any import errors or missing dependencies\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n**Risk**: Low - Well-defined bug with clear error symptoms\n\n### Milestone 2: Frontend Integration Testing & Validation\n**Duration**: 30-60 minutes  \n**Objective**: Ensure frontend properly integrates with fixed backend endpoint\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Frontend API integration validation\n- End-to-end testing verification\n- Error handling improvements (if needed)\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Frontend polls endpoint without 404 errors in browser console\n- Generated files display correctly in UI when available\n- Graceful handling when backend temporarily unavailable\n- No BOM character issues in frontend processing\n\n**Key Tasks**:\n- Test frontend API calls to fixed backend\n- Verify polling logic works correctly\n- Check error handling and display\n- Validate file display in Generated Files component\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 completion\n**Risk**: Low - Primarily validation and testing\n\n## Technical Scope\n\n### Files to Examine/Modify:\n**Backend**:\n- `backend/main.py` (line 717: `/api/activity/files` endpoint)\n- `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py` (if database issues)\n- `src/runtime/agents/runtime.py` (if AgentRuntime integration issues)\n\n**Frontend**: \n- `frontend/src/services/api.js` (`getGeneratedFiles()` function)\n- `frontend/src/App.jsx` (polling logic)\n- `frontend/src/components/GeneratedFiles.jsx` (error handling)\n\n### Expected API Contract:\n```json\n{\n  "files": [...],\n  "count": 0\n}\n```\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n**Low Risk**: \n- Well-defined bug with specific error messages\n- Clear endpoint and error location identified\n- Existing code structure appears sound\n- No major architectural changes needed\n\n**Mitigation**:\n- Focus on minimal changes to fix specific issue\n- Preserve existing functionality\n- Test thoroughly before completion\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n1. **Zero 404 errors** from `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n2. **Clean JSON response** without BOM characters  \n3. **UI functionality restored** - files display without errors\n4. **Backward compatibility** maintained\n5. **Clear error logging** for future debugging\n\n## Project Completion Criteria\n\n- [ ] Backend endpoint returns 200 OK responses\n- [ ] Frontend receives valid JSON data\n- [ ] No console errors related to file fetching\n- [ ] Generated files appear in UI when created\n- [ ] All acceptance tests pass\n- [ ] Code changes committed to version control\n\n## Estimated Total Duration: 2-3 hours'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016fbi6KM4zU24S8w6qwjmoZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_020313.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backu