, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T02:03:15.037100", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Ensemble UI Reimplementation\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FeHqyEsS46qtLSsZaUEzQA', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# Ensemble UI System Requirements\n\n## Project Vision\nRebuild the Ensemble UI system with a focus on modularity, extensibility, and user-friendly design for AI agent collaboration.\n\n## Core Objectives\n1. Create a web-based interface for managing AI agent workflows\n2. Support dynamic agent spawning and task allocation\n3. Provide real-time status tracking and visualization\n\n## Key Features\n- Agent Management Interface\n- Workflow Visualization\n- Task Tracking Dashboard\n- Extensible Architecture\n\n## Technical Constraints\n- Frontend: React with TypeScript\n- Backend: Python FastAPI\n- State Management: Redux/Context API\n- Responsive Design\n- Accessibility Compliance\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Advanced ML model training\n- Complex backend processing\n- Third-party integrations beyond core system\n\n## Success Criteria\n- Functional agent management system\n- Intuitive user interface\n- Performance under 100ms response time\n- 90% test coverage\n- WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility Compliance\n\n## Assumptions\n- Users are technical professionals familiar with AI workflows\n- Deployment will be cloud-based (AWS/GCP)\n- Incremental feature rollout acceptable'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FeHqyEsS46qtLSsZaUEzQA', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/