throughout the system\\n\\n## Functional Requirements\\n\\n### 1. Base Project Setup\\n- Initialize React project with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS\\n- Configure proper project structure matching architecture\\n- Ensure proper development tooling (linting, formatting)\\n\\n### 2. WebSocket Communication Service  \\n- Establish reliable WebSocket connection to backend\\n- Implement automatic reconnection logic\\n- Provide typed event handlers for agent updates\\n- Handle connection state management\\n\\n### 3. Problem Submission Interface\\n- Create responsive form for problem input\\n- Validate user input before submission\\n- Send POST requests to `/api/problems` endpoint\\n- Handle submission errors gracefully\\n\\n### 4. Agent Status Management\\n- Implement React Context for agent state tracking\\n- Store and update agent hierarchy in real-time\\n- Provide query methods for component access\\n- Handle error states appropriately\\n\\n### 5. Execution Status Panel\\n- Display dynamic agent hierarchy visualization\\n- Show real-time execution progress\\n- Handle multiple concurrent agent executions\\n- Visualize error states clearly\\n\\n### 6. Results Display Component\\n- Present comprehensive execution results\\n- Support multiple result formats\\n- Maintain professional, clean design\\n- Handle various result types and error states\\n\\n### 7. Error Handling Service\\n- Centralized error capture and logging\\n- User-friendly error notifications\\n- Integration with WebSocket error events\\n- Graceful degradation on failures\\n\\n## Technical Requirements\\n- **Framework**: React 18+ with TypeScript\\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS for responsive design\\n- **Communication**: WebSocket client for real-time updates\\n- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library with TDD approach\\n- **Code Quality**: ESLint, Prettier, TypeScript strict mode\\n\\n## Implementation Dependencies\\nSequential implementation required following the documented task order:\\n1. Base Project Setup \\u2192 2. WebSocket Service \\u2192 3. Problem Form \\u2192 4. Agent Context \\u2192 5. Status Panel \\u2192 6. Results Display \\u2192 7. Error Handling\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- All 7 documented tasks implemented with passing tests\\n- TDD methodology followed (tests written before implementation)\\n- Real-time WebSocket communication functional\\n- Complete problem submission to results display workflow\\n- Professional UI/UX with responsive design\\n- Comprehensive error handling throughout\\n\\n## Scope Constraints\\n- **In Scope**: All tasks documented in frontend_tasks.md\\n- **Out of Scope**: Backend modifications, new feature additions beyond documented tasks\\n- **Technology Stack**: Fixed to React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS as specified\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n- Backend WebSocket and REST API endpoints are functional\\n- Development environment supports React 18+ and TypeScript\\n- Standard development toolchain available (npm/yarn, Node.js)\\n- Testing infrastructure supports Jest and React Testing Library"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016HrJdupXSqyijzk1hMExN3', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'project_name': 'Frontend Tasks Implementation'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016HrJdupXSqyijzk1hMExN3', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01N6AycshtCs93fHL86tNMWr', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'project_name': 'Frontend Tasks Implementation', 'output_file': '/Users/matt