eliverables\n- Renamed support agents:\n  - `drill_writer.md` → `documentation_writer.md`\n  - `logistics_manager.md` → `project_manager.md` \n  - `visual_tech.md` → `architect_assistant.md`\n- Updated spawn path references throughout codebase\n- Verification tests confirming no broken references\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Zero drum corps references in agent files\n- All spawn paths updated to use new names\n- All existing tests pass after changes\n- No broken agent references in runtime\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 1 completion\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 3: Project Generation Feasibility Assessment\n**Duration**: 1-2 days\n**Priority**: MEDIUM\n\n#### Objective\nValidate that Ensemble can successfully generate complete, independent projects.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- `FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md` - Technical assessment document\n- Test project generation with simple requirements\n- Gap analysis identifying any missing capabilities\n- Performance analysis of agent coordination\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Clear yes/no answer: Can Ensemble generate projects?\n- Documented proof-of-concept project generation\n- Identified gaps (if any) with remediation plans\n- Performance benchmarks for generation time\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 2 completion (clean agent structure needed)\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 4: Documentation & User Guide Creation\n**Duration**: 1-2 days  \n**Priority**: MEDIUM\n\n#### Objective\nCreate comprehensive documentation enabling users to generate projects with 10-minute onboarding.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- `PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md` - Step-by-step user guide\n- Updated README with project generation section\n- Example requirements templates\n- Troubleshooting guide for common issues\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Complete user guide enabling 10-minute onboarding\n- Example project generation walkthrough\n- Clear troubleshooting documentation\n- Updated main documentation reflecting new capabilities\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 3 completion (need feasibility confirmation)\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk\n- **Breaking Changes**: Renaming agents could break existing spawn references\n- **Mitigation**: Comprehensive testing after each rename, maintain reference mapping\n\n### Medium Risk  \n- **Feasibility Gaps**: Ensemble may lack capabilities for complete project generation\n- **Mitigation**: Early feasibility assessment, clear gap identification\n\n### Low Risk\n- **Documentation Completeness**: May miss edge cases in user guide\n- **Mitigation**: Include troubleshooting section, iterative improvement\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Technical Success\n1. Zero drum corps references in active agent files\n2. All support/ agents use industry-standard names\n3. All spawn paths updated and functional\n4. Complete project generation demonstrated\n\n### Business Success\n1. PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md enables 10-minute onboarding\n2. FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md provides definitive capability answer\n3. Ensemble positioned for independent project generation\n4. Clear documentation for future development\n\n## Resource Requirements\n- Development Manager (this agent) for coordination\n- System Architect for technical validation\n- All Coordinators for task breakdown verification\n- TDD Coordinator for implementation testing\n\n## Timeline Summary\n- **Milestone 1**: 1-2 days\n- **Milestone 2**: 2-3 days  \n- **Milestone 3**: 1-2 days\n- **Milestone 4**: 1-2 days\n\n**Total Estimated Duration**: 6-9 days\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Begin Milestone 1: Naming Audit\n2. Spawn System Architect for architecture validation\n3. Begin sequential milestone execution'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Jotct4tPUvDSsaX2kUQYD2', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/mile