lders)\\n- **leadership/**: Strategic and management agents\\n- **coordinators/**: Task breakdown specialists\\n- **developers/**: Code implementation agents\\n- **testers/**: Test writing agents\\n- **designers/**: UI/styling agents\\n- **support/**: Supporting utilities (needs rename)\\n\\n### 3. Output Isolation\\nProjects are generated in a specified `output_directory`, ensuring:\\n- No pollution of Ensemble codebase\\n- Complete project isolation\\n- Configurable output paths\\n\\n## Naming Standards\\n\\n### Current State vs. Target State\\n\\n| Category | Current | Target | Status |\\n|----------|---------|--------|--------|\\n| Leadership | executive_director.md | executive_director.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Leadership | development_manager.md | development_manager.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Leadership | system_architect.md | system_architect.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Leadership | tdd_coordinator.md | tdd_coordinator.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Coordinators | backend_coordinator.md | backend_coordinator.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Coordinators | frontend_coordinator.md | frontend_coordinator.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Coordinators | test_coordinator.md | test_coordinator.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Developers | backend_lead.md | backend_lead.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Developers | backend_developer.md | backend_developer.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Developers | frontend_lead.md | frontend_lead.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Developers | frontend_developer.md | frontend_developer.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Testers | unit_test_lead.md | unit_test_lead.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Testers | unit_test_writer.md | unit_test_writer.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Testers | integration_test_lead.md | integration_test_lead.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Testers | integration_test_writer.md | integration_test_writer.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Designers | style_developer.md | style_developer.md | \\u2705 OK |\\n| Support | drill_writer.md | documentation_writer.md | \\u26a0\\ufe0f RENAME |\\n| Support | logistics_manager.md | project_manager.md | \\u26a0\\ufe0f RENAME |\\n| Support | visual_tech.md | architect_assistant.md | \\u26a0\\ufe0f RENAME |\\n\\n## Technical Architecture\\n\\n### Spawn Path Convention\\n```\\nspawn_agent(\\"<category>/<agent_name>\\", {input_data})\\n```\\n\\nExamples:\\n- `spawn_agent(\\"leadership/development_manager\\", {...})`\\n- `spawn_agent(\\"coordinators/backend_coordinator\\", {...})`\\n- `spawn_agent(\\"developers/backend_lead\\", {...})`\\n\\n### Input/Output Contracts\\n\\n#### Executive Director Input\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"requirements_file\\": \\"path/to/requirements.md\\",\\n  \\"output_directory\\": \\"path/to/output\\",\\n  \\"project_name\\": \\"string\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### Development Manager Input\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"requirements_file\\": \\"path/to/requirements.md\\",\\n  \\"output_directory\\": \\"path/to/output\\",\\n  \\"project_name\\": \\"string\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### Coordinator Input\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"milestone\\": \\"description of milestone\\",\\n  \\"architecture\\": \\"path/to/architecture.md\\",\\n  \\"requirements\\": \\"path/to/requirements.md\\",\\n  \\"output_file\\": \\"path/to/tasks.md\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### TDD Coordinator Input\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"problem_description\\": \\"what to build\\",\\n  \\"output_directory\\": \\"where to put code\\",\\n  \\"test_directory\\": \\"where to put tests (optional)\\",\\n  \\"requirements_file\\": \\"path/to/requirements.md (optional)\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Deliverables for This Project\\n\\n### Milestone 1: Naming Audit\\n- `NAMING_AUDIT_REPORT.md` - Comprehensive audit results\\n\\n### Milestone 2: Naming Standardization\\n- Renamed support/ agents\\n- Updated spawn path references\\n- Verification tests\\n\\n### Milestone 3: Feasibility Assessment\\n- `FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md` - Can Ensemble generate new projects?\\n- Gap analysis (if any)\\n\\n### Milestone 4: Documentation\\n- `PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md` - Usage documentation\\n- Updated README if needed\\n\\n## Risk Mitigation\\n\\n### Breaking Changes\\n- Run all tests after any rename\\n- Update all spawn path references\\n- Maintain backward compatibility where possible\\n\\n### Documentation Gaps\\n- Create clear step-by-step guides\\n- Include troubleshooting sections\\n- Provide example workflows\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n1. Zero drum corps references in active agent files\\n2. All support/ agents renamed to industry standards\\n3. PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md enables 10-minute onboarding\\n4. FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md provides clear yes/no answer\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Jotct4tPUvDSsaX2kUQYD2', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Ensemble Project Generation Capability - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nEnable Ensemble to generate completely new, independent software applications with standardized naming conventions and comprehensive documentation.\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Naming Audit & Standards Assessment\n**Duration**: 1-2 days  \n**Priority**: HIGH\n\n#### Objective\nComplete comprehensive audit of agent naming conventions and identify standardization requirements.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- `NAMING_AUDIT_REPORT.md` - Complete analysis of current vs. target naming\n- Identification of all agent files requiring renaming\n- Documentation of all spawn path references that need updating\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- All agent files catalogued with current and target names\n- Zero drum corps references identified and documented\n- Clear mapping of required changes for support/ agents\n- Risk assessment for breaking changes\n\n#### Dependencies\n- None (starting milestone)\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 2: Naming Standardization Implementation  \n**Duration**: 2-3 days  \n**Priority**: HIGH\n\n#### Objective\nImplement standardized naming conventions across all agents, eliminating drum corps references.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- Renamed support agents:\n  - `drill_writer.md` → `documentation_writer.md`\n  - `logistics_manager.md` → `project_manager.md` \n  - `visual_tech.md` → `architect_assistant.md`\n- Updated spawn path references throughout codebase\n- Verification tests confirming no broken references\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Zero drum corps references in agent files\n- All spawn paths updated to use new names\n- All existing tests pass after changes\n- No broken agent references in runtime\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 1 completion\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 3: Project Generation Feasibility Assessment\n**Duration**: 1-2 days\n**Priority**: MEDIUM\n\n#### Objective\nValidate that Ensemble can successfully generate complete, independent projects.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- `FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md` - Technical assessment document\n- Test project generation with simple requirements\n- Gap analysis identifying any missing capabilities\n- Performance analysis of agent coordination\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Clear yes/no answer: Can Ensemble generate projects?\n- Documented proof-of-concept project generation\n- Identified gaps (if any) with remediation plans\n- Performance benchmarks for generation time\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 2 completion (clean agent structure needed)\n\n---\n\n### Milestone 4: Documentation & User Guide Creation\n**Duration**: 1-2 days  \n**Priority**: MEDIUM\n\n#### Objective\nCreate comprehensive documentation enabling users to generate projects with 10-minute onboarding.\n\n#### Deliverables\n- `PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md` - Step-by-step user guide\n- Updated README with project generation section\n- Example requirements templates\n- Troubleshooting guide for common issues\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria\n- Complete user guide enabling 10-minute onboarding\n- Example project generation walkthrough\n- Clear troubleshooting documentation\n- Updated main documentation reflecting new capabilities\n\n#### Dependencies\n- Milestone 3 completion (need feasibility confirmation)\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk\n- **Breaking Changes**: Renaming agents could break existing spawn references\n- **Mitigation**: Comprehensive testing after each rename, maintain reference mapping\n\n### Medium Risk  \n- **Feasibility Gaps**: Ensemble may lack capabilities for complete project generation\n- **Mitigation**: Early feasibility assessment, clear gap identification\n\n### Low Risk\n- **Documentation Completeness**: May miss edge cases in user guide\n- **Mitigation**: Include troubleshooting section, iterative improvement\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Technical Success\n1. Zero drum corps references in active agent files\n2. All support/ agents use industry-standard names\n3. All spawn paths updated and functional\n4. Complete project generation demonstrated\n\n### Business Success\n1. PROJECT_GENERATION_GUIDE.md enables 10-minute onboarding\n2. FEASIBILITY_ASSESSMENT.md provides definitive capability answer\n3. Ensemble positioned for independent project generation\n4. Clear documentation for future development\n\n## Resource Requirements\n- Development Manager (this agent) for coordination\n- System Architect for technical validation\n- All Coordinators for task breakdown verification\n- TDD Coordinator for implementation testing\n\n## Timeline Summary\n- **Milestone 1**: 1-2 days\n- **Milestone 2**: 2-3 days  \n- **Milestone 3**: 1-2 days\n- **Milestone 4**: 1-2 days\n\n**Total Estimated Duration**: 6-9 days\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Begin Milestone 1: Naming Audit\n2. Spawn System Architect for architecture validation\n3. Begin sequential milestone execution'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Jotct4tPUvDSsaX2kUQYD2', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_022634.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_022634.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01WwPfz6xEjjiMt9B2YQiF1C', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/epgc_architecture.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Ensemble Project Generation Capability'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01WwPfz6xEjjiMt9B2YQiF1C', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executive Director, coordinate System Architect/Coordinators/TDD Coordinator.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NEVER write code yourself** - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. **If spawn_agent fails, STOP and return error** - DO NOT write code as fallback\n3. **Execute ALL steps sequentially** - don\'t stop after planning\n4. **Use EXACT agent paths** - see examples below\n5. **SPAWN VALIDATION REQUIRED** - See [Common Instructions - Spawn Agent Validation](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/common_instructions.md#spawn-agent-validation) - ALL spawn_agent calls MUST use ACTUAL VALUES, not placeholders\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Write Locations** (Documentation Only):\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md` - Architecture documents\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone plans\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m[N].md` - Backend task breakdowns\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m[N].md` - Frontend task breakdowns\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m[N].md` - Test task breakdowns\n\n**Code Directories** (Specify for Spawned Agents):\nWhen spawning TDD Coordinator or Coordinators, tell them WHERE to write code:\n\n**Frontend Code Paths**:\n\n\n**Backend Code Paths**:\n\n\n**Test Paths**:\n\n\n**When Spawning TDD Coordinator**, provide specific directories:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**1. Read Requirements & Check Gaps**\nRead requirements file\n**BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable technical decisions - ONLY ask if critical business decisions needed\nMissing: tech stack details → use modern defaults from requirements\nMissing: architecture patterns → use standard patterns (MVC, microservices, etc.)\nAmbiguous implementation → choose best practice approach\n**ONLY escalate when**: User must choose between major trade-offs (cost, security, compliance)\n\n**2. Create Milestones**\nBreak into logical, deliverable chunks\nEach milestone: objective, deliverables, acceptance criteria, dependencies\nWrite milestone plan document\n\n**3. Architecture - USE spawn_agent TOOL**\n**CRITICAL: Use spawn_agent tool**: spawn_agent("leadership/system_architect", {requirements_file})\nReview System Architect\'s architecture output\nIf major decisions need user input → escalate to Executive Director\n\n**4. Task Breakdown (for FIRST milestone) - USE spawn_agent TOOL**\n**CRITICAL: Actually use spawn_agent tool**, don\'t just write task files\nFor milestone 1