t handlers in `/src/ensemble/main.py`\n- Add event emission points throughout agent execution lifecycle\n- Implement progress state management\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 2: Automatic Error Recovery & Context Preservation\n**Duration**: 3-4 days  \n**Priority**: HIGH  \n**Phase**: Reliability Enhancement\n\n### Objective\nImplement intelligent error recovery with automatic retries and full context preservation for resume after failures.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Complete state manager resume functionality (message reconstruction)\n2. Retry logic with exponential backoff for transient failures\n3. Context preservation for spawned agents (parent context + partial results)\n4. Automatic checkpoint validation and rollback\n5. Error classification system (retryable vs. fatal)\n6. Tool execution result preservation across retries\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ Agents can resume from last checkpoint after crashes\n- ✅ Transient API errors trigger automatic retry\n- ✅ Failed spawns preserve parent agent state for debugging\n- ✅ Context includes: conversation history, tool results, spawned agent data\n- ✅ Recovery success rate > 80% for retryable errors\n- ✅ Zero token waste on successful recovery\n\n### Dependencies\n- Milestone 1 (progress monitoring for recovery status)\n\n### Technical Focus\n- Complete `/src/ensemble/state.py` StateManager resume functionality\n- Enhance `/src/ensemble/runtime.py` with retry logic\n- Add error classification and recovery strategies\n- Implement checkpoint validation system\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 3: Agent Performance Analytics & Adaptive Optimization\n**Duration**: 2-3 days  \n**Priority**: MEDIUM  \n**Phase**: Optimization & Intelligence\n\n### Objective\nImplement comprehensive analytics tracking with adaptive model selection based on historical success rates.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Agent metrics tracking system (token usage, execution time, success rates)\n2. Aggregated metrics by agent type and model tier\n3. Analytics dashboard endpoint for reporting\n4. Adaptive model selection implementation\n5. Performance comparison reports (model A vs B)\n6. Metrics export functionality (JSON, CSV)\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ All agent executions tracked with complete metrics\n- ✅ Analytics API returns per-agent and aggregate statistics\n- ✅ Adaptive model selection improves success rate by 15%+\n- ✅ Token usage optimization reduces costs by 10%+\n- ✅ Reports identify underperforming agents for refinement\n- ✅ Metrics persist across system restarts\n\n### Dependencies\n- Milestone 1 (progress data for metrics)\n- Milestone 2 (recovery data for success rates)\n\n### Technical Focus\n- Create new `AgentAnalytics` module\n- Add metrics collection throughout agent lifecycle\n- Implement adaptive model selection logic\n- Build analytics API endpoints\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 4: Testing, Documentation & Integration\n**Duration**: 1-2 days  \n**Priority**: HIGH  \n**Phase**: Quality Assurance\n\n### Objective\nComplete comprehensive testing, update documentation, and ensure seamless integration of all improvements.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Test suite covering all new functionality\n2. Performance benchmarks (before/after comparison)\n3. Updated documentation (README, implementation guide)\n4. Integration testing across all three improvements\n5. Final system validation and optimization\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ 100% test coverage for new functionality\n- ✅ All existing tests continue to pass\n- ✅ Performance benchmarks show improvement\n- ✅ Documentation accurately reflects new capabilities\n- ✅ System ready for production deployment\n\n### Dependencies\n- Milestones 1, 2, 3 (all improvements implemented)\n\n### Technical Focus\n- Comprehensive testing across all modules\n- Performance validation and optimization\n- Documentation updates and examples\n- Final integration testing\n\n---\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n### High Risk Items\n1. **API Rate Limits**: Implement proper backoff and retry logic\n2. **State Corruption**: Add validation and rollback mechanisms  \n3. **Performance Regression**: Continuous monitoring during development\n4. **Backward Compatibility**: Maintain existing agent definition format\n\n### Mitigation Strategies\n- Incremental implementation with rollback capability\n- Extensive testing at each milestone\n- Performance monitoring throughout development\n- Staged deployment approach\n\n---\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n### User Experience\n- Real-time progress visibility (Milestone 1)\n- Reduced failure rates through recovery (Milestone 2)\n- Improved system performance through optimization (Milestone 3)\n\n### Technical Metrics  \n- Error recovery success rate > 80%\n- Progress update latency < 500ms\n- Token usage optimization > 10% cost reduction\n- Agent success rate improvement > 15%\n\n### Quality Assurance\n- Zero breaking changes to existing functionality\n- 100% test coverage for new features\n- Performance overhead < 5%\n- Documentation completeness score > 95%\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Begin Milestone 1: Progress Streaming implementation\n2. Set up development environment and testing framework\n3. Start with AgentRuntime enhancement for event emission\n4. Implement WebSocket streaming for progress updates'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012XmvY3pMZ2uq3HKQcEbDjN', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025842.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025842.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requiremen