src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/`\\n- **Output Directory**: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/`\\n\\n## Technical Investigation Required\\n\\n### 1. Backend Status\\n- Verify backend server is running on expected port (8001)\\n- Check if endpoint registration is correct\\n- Validate endpoint handler function exists and is accessible\\n\\n### 2. Frontend API Calls\\n- Review `getGeneratedFiles()` function in `frontend/src/services/api.js`\\n- Verify correct URL construction and parameters\\n- Check polling interval and frequency (currently set to 1000ms in App.jsx)\\n\\n### 3. Potential Root Causes\\n- Backend server not running or crashed\\n- Endpoint URL mismatch between frontend and backend\\n- CORS configuration issues\\n- Activity tracker database connectivity problems\\n- Missing dependencies or import errors in backend\\n\\n## Files to Examine\\n\\n### Backend Files\\n1. `backend/main.py` - Main FastAPI application\\n   - Line 717: `@app.get(\\"/api/activity/files\\")` endpoint definition\\n   - Activity tracker integration\\n   - Error handling\\n\\n2. Backend runtime dependencies:\\n   - `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py` - Activity tracking system\\n   - `src/runtime/agents/runtime.py` - AgentRuntime class\\n\\n### Frontend Files\\n1. `frontend/src/services/api.js` - API service layer\\n   - `getGeneratedFiles()` function\\n   - API_BASE_URL configuration\\n\\n2. `frontend/src/App.jsx` - Main application component\\n   - Polling logic for file updates\\n   - Error handling display\\n\\n3. `frontend/src/components/GeneratedFiles.jsx` - Files display component\\n\\n## Expected Behavior\\n\\n1. Frontend polls `/api/activity/files` endpoint at configured interval\\n2. Backend returns JSON response with generated files:\\n   ```json\\n   {\\n     \\"files\\": [...],\\n     \\"count\\": 0\\n   }\\n   ```\\n3. UI displays files in the \\"Generated Files\\" section without errors\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n1. **No 404 errors** when frontend polls files endpoint\\n2. **Correct response format** - JSON without BOM characters\\n3. **Files displayed** in UI when agents generate outputs\\n4. **Error handling** - Graceful degradation if backend temporarily unavailable\\n5. **Logging** - Clear error messages in both frontend console and backend logs\\n\\n## Constraints\\n\\n- **No breaking changes** to existing API contract\\n- **Maintain backwards compatibility** with current frontend implementation\\n- **Minimal code changes** - focus on fixing the specific 404 issue\\n- **Preserve existing functionality** - don\'t break other endpoints\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n\\n- Adding new features to file display\\n- Redesigning the UI layout\\n- Changing polling architecture to WebSockets\\n- Performance optimization beyond fixing the bug\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n\\n- Backend is intended to run on port 8001\\n- Frontend is configured to connect to localhost:8001\\n- Activity tracker database exists and is accessible at `~/.ensemble/metrics.db`\\n- All required Python dependencies are installed\\n\\n## Acceptance Tests\\n\\n1. **Backend health check**: `curl http://localhost:8001/api/status` returns 200 OK\\n2. **Files endpoint test**: `curl http://localhost:8001/api/activity/files` returns JSON (not 404)\\n3. **Frontend test**: Open UI in browser, verify no 404 errors in console for `/api/activity/files`\\n4. **Integration test**: Generate a file via agent execution, verify it appears in UI without errors\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n1. **Root cause analysis** - Document why 404 was occurring\\n2. **Code fixes** - Implement solution in backend/frontend as needed\\n3. **Verification** - Test all affected endpoints work correctly\\n4. **Documentation** - Update any relevant docs about endpoint usage\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PqVfhFj2iQRfxcUh2Edhxx', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# UI Files 404 Error Fix - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Objective**: Fix 404 "Not Found" errors when frontend polls `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n**Duration**: 1-2 development cycles\n**Priority**: High (blocking user functionality)\n\n## Milestone 1: Root Cause Analysis & Backend Fix\n**Duration**: 1 development cycle\n**Objective**: Identify and fix the backend 404 issue\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. **Root cause analysis document**\n   - Backend server status verification\n   - Endpoint registration analysis\n   - Error reproduction and diagnosis\n\n2. **Backend fixes implemented**\n   - Fix endpoint registration if broken\n   - Ensure proper response formatting (no BOM)\n   - Add error handling and logging\n\n3. **Backend verification**\n   - Manual curl testing of endpoint\n   - Response format validation\n   - Error handling testing\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- [ ] `curl http://localhost:8001/api/activity/files` returns 200 OK with valid JSON\n- [ ] No BOM characters in response\n- [ ] Backend logs show proper request handling\n- [ ] Error handling gracefully returns appropriate status codes\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Backend server must be startable\n- Activity tracker database accessible\n- Python dependencies installed\n\n## Milestone 2: Frontend Integration & Testing\n**Duration**: 0.5 development cycles\n**Objective**: Verify frontend integration and complete end-to-end testing\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. **Frontend verification**\n   - Confirm API calls use correct URL\n   - Verify polling logic works correctly\n   - Test error handling in UI\n\n2. **Integration testing**\n   - End-to-end workflow testing\n   - File generation and display verification\n   - Cross-browser compatibility check\n\n3. **Documentation updates**\n   - API endpoint documentation\n   - Troubleshooting guide\n   - Known issues documentation\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- [ ] No 404 errors in browser console for `/api/activity/files`\n- [ ] Generated files appear correctly in UI\n- [ ] Graceful error handling when backend unavailable\n- [ ] All existing functionality preserved\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Milestone 1 completion\n- Frontend development environment\n- Test file generation capability\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk:\n- Backend configuration issues preventing startup\n- Database connectivity problems\n\n### Medium Risk:\n- CORS configuration conflicts\n- Frontend polling logic issues\n\n### Low Risk:\n- Response format inconsistencies\n- Error message display problems\n\n## Rollback Plan\nIf issues arise:\n1. Revert backend changes to last working state\n2. Disable file polling temporarily in frontend\n3. Document known issues for future resolution\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Zero 404 errors on `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n- Files display correctly in UI within 2 seconds of generation\n- No regression in other API endpoints\n- Clean error logs without spam'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01PqVfhFj2iQRfxcUh2Edhxx', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executi