{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 02:59:09", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-3f3e8c3b-5c53-49fd-b64e-d287bbd3dbf2', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/smart_task_decomposition_milestones.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Smart Task Decomposition System",\n  "project_id": "7f917a6b",\n  "task_id": "dab5e173"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01WQKNQRs1PBbcUVnYHh6jCd', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/smart_task_decomposition_milestones.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01WQKNQRs1PBbcUVnYHh6jCd', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Smart Task Decomposition Engine - Milestone Plan\\n\\n## Project Overview\\nImplement a comprehensive Task Decomposition Engine for Ensemble AI that analyzes complex user requests, generates dependency graphs, estimates resources, and presents execution plans for user approval.\\n\\n## Milestones\\n\\n### Milestone 1: Core Infrastructure & Decomposition Engine\\n**Objective**: Build the core decomposition engine with task analysis and dependency graph generation.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `src/runtime/agents/decomposition_engine.py` - Core engine with:\\n   - Pydantic data models (TaskAnalysis, SubTask, DecompositionPlan, ResourceEstimate, AllocationPlan, Schedule)\\n   - `TaskDecompositionEngine` class with all core methods\\n   - NetworkX-based DAG generation and validation\\n   - Resource estimation and allocation optimization\\n   - Execution schedule generation\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Can analyze task complexity and domain\\n- Generates valid DAGs (no cycles)\\n- Produces resource estimates with cost calculations\\n- Creates parallel execution waves\\n\\n**Dependencies**: None\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 2: Learning Module\\n**Objective**: Build the learning module for continuous improvement of estimates.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `src/runtime/agents/decomposition_learner.py` - Learning module with:\\n   - `DecompositionLearner` class\\n   - Execution recording and history storage\\n   - Estimate improvement based on historical data\\n   - Accuracy metrics tracking\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Records execution outcomes\\n- Improves estimates over time\\n- Provides accuracy metrics\\n- Suggests improvements based on patterns\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (uses DecompositionPlan models)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 3: Executive Director Integration\\n**Objective**: Integrate decomposition engine into Executive Director workflow.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. Updated `leadership/executive_director.md` with:\\n   - New decomposition workflow\\n   - Extended output format with `decomposition_plan` field\\n   - User approval flow for plans\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Executive Director uses decomposition before spawning agents\\n- Output includes decomposition plan\\n- Supports plan approval workflow\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 4: API Endpoints\\n**Objective**: Add backend API endpoints for decomposition functionality.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. Updated `src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py` with:\\n   - `POST /api/decompose` - Decompose user request\\n   - `POST /api/approve-plan` - Accept/reject/modify plans\\n   - `GET /api/decomposition-history` - Historical accuracy\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All endpoints functional\\n- Proper error handling\\n- Integration with decomposition engine\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 5: Frontend Visualization\\n**Objective**: Build React component for task decomposition visualization.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/TaskDecompositionViewer.jsx` with:\\n   - Mermaid diagram rendering\\n   - Resource estimates display\\n   - Execution wave visualization\\n   - Agent assignment table\\n   - Approve/Reject/Modify buttons\\n   - Plan modification interface\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Renders dependency graph with Mermaid\\n- Displays resource estimates\\n- Action buttons work correctly\\n- Responsive UI\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 4 (needs API endpoints)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 6: Test Suite\\n**Objective**: Comprehensive testing for all decomposition functionality.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `tests/test_decomposition.py` with:\\n   - Unit tests for each method\\n   - Integration tests for full flow\\n   - Graph validity tests\\n   - Benchmark tests (simple, medium, complex)\\n   - Learning accuracy tests\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All unit tests pass\\n- Integration tests cover full workflow\\n- DAG validity verified\\n- Performance benchmarks documented\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2, 4\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 7: Documentation\\n**Objective**: Complete documentation for the decomposition engine.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `TASK_DECOMPOSITION.md` with:\\n   - Architecture overview\\n   - Usage examples\\n   - API reference\\n   - Configuration options\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Clear architecture explanation\\n- Working code examples\\n- Complete API documentation\\n- Configuration fully documented\\n\\n**Dependencies**: All previous milestones\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Execution Order\\n1. Milestone 1 (Core Engine) - Foundation\\n2. Milestone 2 (Learning Module) - Builds on engine\\n3. Milestones 3, 4 (Integration + API) - Can run in parallel\\n4. Milestone 5 (Frontend) - Needs API\\n5. Milestone 6 (Tests) - Needs all code\\n6. Milestone 7 (Documentation) - Final\\n\\n## Estimated Timeline\\n- Milestones 1-2: Core implementation\\n- Milestones 3-5: Integration and UI\\n- Milestones 6-7: Quality and documentation\\n\\n## Risk Assessment\\n- **Medium Risk**: NetworkX/PuLP integration complexity\\n- **Low Risk**: Standard patterns for API/UI\\n- **Mitigation**: Use existing project patterns, fallback to simpler algorithms if needed\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MEossKT1MbW2GvGuwdqYQj', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Smart Task Decomposition System', 'description': 'Implement a comprehensive Task Decomposition Engine for Ensemble AI that analyzes complex user requests, generates dependency graphs, estimates resources, and presents execution plans for user approval.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MEossKT1MbW2GvGuwdqYQj', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "24812df0", "message": "Created project: Smart Task Decomposition System", "summary": {"project_id": "24812df0", "project_name": "Smart Task Decomposition System", "description": "Implement a comprehensive Task Decomposition Engine for Ensemble AI that analyzes complex user requests, generates dependency graphs, estimates resources, and presents execution plans for user approval.", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T02:58:25.523566", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T02:58:25.523566", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T02:58:25.523566", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Smart Task Decomposition System\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016SjD9srMoWrpTGvBXVWqBa', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/smart_task_decomposition_milestones.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Smart Task Decomposition System', 'project_id': '7f917a6b', 'task_id': 'dab5e173'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016SjD9srMoWrpTGvBXVWqBa', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01KguXYW2Q5LYSHazCRpshCE', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/smart_task_decomposition_milestones.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'Smart Task Decomposition System', 'project_id': '7f917a6b', 'task_id': 'dab5e173'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01KguXYW2Q5LYSHazCRpshCE', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executive Director, coordinate System Architect/Coordinators/TDD Coordinator.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NEVER write code yourself** - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. **If spawn_agent fails, STOP and return error** - DO NOT write code as fallback\n3. **Execute ALL steps sequentially** - don\'t stop after planning\n4. **Use EXACT agent paths** - see examples below\n5. **SPAWN VALIDATION REQUIRED** - See [Common Instructions - Spawn Agent Validation](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/common_instructions.md#spawn-agent-validation) - ALL spawn_agent calls MUST use ACTUAL VALUES, not placeholders\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Write Locations** (Documentation Only):\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md` - Architecture documents\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone plans\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m[N].md` - Backend task breakdowns\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m[N].md` - Frontend task breakdowns\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m[N].md` - Test task breakdowns\n\n**Code Directories** (Specify for Spawned Agents):\nWhen spawning TDD Coordinator or Coordinators, tell them WHERE to write code:\n\n**Frontend Code Paths**:\n\n\n**Backend Code Paths**:\n\n\n**Test Paths**:\n\n\n**When Spawning TDD Coordinator**, provide specific directories:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**1. Read Requirements & Check Gaps**\nRead requirements file\n**BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable technical decisions - ONLY ask if critical business decisions needed\nMissing: tech stack details → use modern defaults from requirements\nMissing: architecture patterns → use standard patterns (MVC, microservices, etc.)\nAmbiguous implementation → choose best practice approach\n**ONLY escalate when**: User must choose between major trade-offs (cost, security, compliance)\n\n**2. Create Milestones**\nBreak into logical, deliverable chunks\nEach milestone: objective, deliverables, acceptance criteria, dependencies\nWrite milestone plan document\n\n**3. Architecture - USE spawn_agent TOOL**\n**CRITICAL: Use spawn_agent tool**: spawn_agent("leadership/system_architect", {requirements_file})\nReview System Architect\'s architecture output\nIf major decisions need user input → escalate to Executive Director\n\n**4. Task Breakdown (for FIRST milestone) - USE spawn_agent TOOL**\n**CRITICAL: Actually use spawn_agent tool**, don\'t just write task files\nFor milestone 1, spawn each Coordinator using spawn_agent with proper inputs:\nspawn_agent("coordinators/backend_coordinator", {\n      "milestone": "description of milestone 1",\n      "architecture": "path/to/architecture.md",\n      "requirements": "path/to/requirements.md",\n      "output_file": "path/to/developer_tasks.md"\n    })\nspawn_agent("coordinators/test_coordinator", {\n      "milestone": "description of milestone 1",\n      "architecture": "path/to/architecture.md",\n      "requirements": "path/to/requirements.md",\n      "output_file": "path/to/test_tasks.md"\n    })\nspawn_agent("coordinators/frontend_coordinator", {similar inputs})\nReview each Coordinator\'s output for task breakdown\nConsolidate task lists, identify dependencies\n\n**5. Implementation (FIRST milestone) - USE spawn_agent TOOL**\n**CRITICAL: Use spawn_agent tool to spawn TDD Coordinator with EXACT path**\n**EXACT PATH**: spawn_agent("leadership/tdd_coordinator", {\n    "problem_description": "description of what to build",\n    "output_directory": "where to put code",\n    "test_directory": "where to put tests (optional)",\n    "requirements_file": "path/to/requirements.md (optional)"\n  })\nTDD Coordinator orchestrates Section Techs/Leaders via TDD\nMonitor TDD Coordinator\'s progress\n**If spawn fails, STOP and return error with details**\n\n**6. Verify Milestone Complete**\nAll tasks done? Tests passing? Quality acceptable? Docs written?\nIf yes → next milestone (repeat 4-6); if no → fix\n\n**7. Project Complete**\nAll milestones done → verify deliverables, run tests, check docs\nCommit all changes to version control (see Git Workflow below)\nReport to Executive Director with status: `success`\n\n### Git Workflow:\n**IMPORTANT**: Commit changes after completing each milestone and at project completion.\n\n**When to commit**:\nAfter milestone planning documents are written\nAfter architecture and task breakdown phases\nAfter each milestone implementation completes\nBefore reporting final completion to Executive Director\n\n**How to commit**:\n\n\n**Commit message guidelines**:\nBe specific: "Complete milestone 1: user authentication backend"\nNot generic: ❌ "update", "changes", "milestone done"\nMention milestone number or phase\nMinimum 10 characters\n\n**Example**:\n\n\n### Workflow Per Milestone:\n\n\n### Your Authority:\nDetermine milestone breakdown\nApprove task plans from Coordinators\nDecide when milestones complete\nEscalate to Executive Director when needed\n\n### Escalate to Executive Director When:\nRequirements gaps\nArchitecture needs user approval\nMajor blockers or scope changes\nQuality issues unresolvable\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{\n  "requirements_file": "string - path to requirements document",\n  "output_directory": "string - where to create artifacts",\n  "project_name": "string - project name"\n}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{\n  "status": "success|in_progress|needs_clarification|failed",\n  "phase": "string - milestones|architecture|task_breakdown|implementation|complete",\n  "milestones": "array of milestones if created",\n  "deliverables": "array of paths to created files",\n  "clarification_needed": "string - questions for Executive Director (optional)",\n  "message": "string - status summary",\n  "self_analysis": "string - REQUIRED: Your performance analysis (2-4 sentences)",\n  "performance_analysis": "string - REQUIRED: Analysis of System Architect, Coordinators, and TDD Coordinator performance (2-4 sentences)"\n}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n- All milestones completed, tests passing, documentation complete\n- Ready to report completion to Executive Director\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 81.5%\n- Average iterations per task: 12.3\n- Common errors to avoid: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError, RateLimitError\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Try to be more efficient - you\'re using more iterations than typical.\n- Watch out for these common errors: CircuitBreakerOpenError, BadRequestError\n\n**Learnings from your recent runs:**\n- I effectively executed the complete planning and implementation workflow for Milestone 1. Successfully coordinated with System Architect for architecture design, spawned all three Coordinators for com...\n- Successfully executed the complete Development Manager workflow from requirements analysis through implementation coordination. Effectively managed the sequential process: milestone planning, architec...\n', 'tools': [{'name': 'write_file', 'description': 'Write content to a file, creating parent directories if needed. Automatically backs up existing files.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Path to the file to write'}, 'content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Content to write to the file'}}, 'required': ['file_path', 'content']}}, {'name': 'read_file', 'description': 'Read content from a file', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Path to the file to read'}}, 'required': ['file_path']}}, {'name': 'run_command', 'description': 'Execute a shell command and return the output', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'command': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The shell command to execute'}, 'working_directory': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Optional working directory for command execution'}}, 'required': ['command']}}, {'name': 'git_commit', 'description': 'Commit changes to the git repository with a descriptive message', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'message': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Commit message describing the changes'}, 'files': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'description': 'Optional list of specific files to commit. If not provided, commits all modified files.'}}, 'required': ['message']}}, {'name': 'git_branch', 'description': 'Create, switch, list, or delete git branches for coordinated development', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['create', 'switch', 'list', 'delete', 'current'], 'description': 'Action to perform: create new branch, switch to existing, list all, delete, or get current'}, 'branch_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Name of the branch (for create, switch, delete)'}, 'from_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Base branch to create from (for create, defaults to current branch)'}, 'force': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Force the operation (for delete unmerged branches)', 'default': False}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'git_merge', 'description': 'Merge branches or create pull requests for code review', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['merge', 'preview', 'abort'], 'description': 'Action: merge branches, preview changes, or abort an in-progress merge'}, 'source_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Branch to merge from'}, 'target_branch': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Branch to merge into (defaults to current branch)'}, 'strategy': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['merge', 'squash', 'rebase'], 'description': 'Merge strategy (default: merge)', 'default': 'merge'}, 'message': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Custom merge commit message (optional)'}, 'no_ff': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Create merge commit even if fast-forward is possible', 'default': True}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'git_status', 'description': 'Get comprehensive git repository status including branches, changes, and history', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'include_history': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Include recent commit history', 'default': False}, 'history_count': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of commits to include in history', 'default': 10}}, 'required': []}}, {'name': 'project_tracking', 'description': 'Manage project state, tasks, and notes for the current project', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'action': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['create_project', 'add_task', 'update_task', 'add_note', 'get_summary', 'get_next_tasks'], 'description': 'Action to perform'}, 'project_id': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Project ID (not needed for create_project)'}, 'project_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Project name (for create_project)'}, 'description': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Description (for create_project or add_task)'}, 'task_id': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Task ID (for update_task)'}, 'status': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['todo', 'in_progress', 'completed', 'blocked', 'cancelled'], 'description': 'Task status (for update_task)'}, 'note': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Note text (for add_note or update_task)'}, 'assigned_to': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Agent type (for add_task)'}, 'category': {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['general', 'decision', 'milestone', 'issue'], 'description': 'Note category (for add_note)'}}, 'required': ['action']}}, {'name': 'spawn_agent', 'descriptio