. **No 404 errors** when frontend polls files endpoint\\n2. **Correct response format** - JSON without BOM characters\\n3. **Files displayed** in UI when agents generate outputs\\n4. **Error handling** - Graceful degradation if backend temporarily unavailable\\n5. **Logging** - Clear error messages in both frontend console and backend logs\\n\\n## Constraints\\n\\n- **No breaking changes** to existing API contract\\n- **Maintain backwards compatibility** with current frontend implementation\\n- **Minimal code changes** - focus on fixing the specific 404 issue\\n- **Preserve existing functionality** - don\'t break other endpoints\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n\\n- Adding new features to file display\\n- Redesigning the UI layout\\n- Changing polling architecture to WebSockets\\n- Performance optimization beyond fixing the bug\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n\\n- Backend is intended to run on port 8001\\n- Frontend is configured to connect to localhost:8001\\n- Activity tracker database exists and is accessible at `~/.ensemble/metrics.db`\\n- All required Python dependencies are installed\\n\\n## Acceptance Tests\\n\\n1. **Backend health check**: `curl http://localhost:8001/api/status` returns 200 OK\\n2. **Files endpoint test**: `curl http://localhost:8001/api/activity/files` returns JSON (not 404)\\n3. **Frontend test**: Open UI in browser, verify no 404 errors in console for `/api/activity/files`\\n4. **Integration test**: Generate a file via agent execution, verify it appears in UI without errors\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n1. **Root cause analysis** - Document why 404 was occurring\\n2. **Code fixes** - Implement solution in backend/frontend as needed\\n3. **Verification** - Test all affected endpoints work correctly\\n4. **Documentation** - Update any relevant docs about endpoint usage\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PqVfhFj2iQRfxcUh2Edhxx', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# UI Files 404 Error Fix - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Objective**: Fix 404 "Not Found" errors when frontend polls `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n**Duration**: 1-2 development cycles\n**Priority**: High (blocking user functionality)\n\n## Milestone 1: Root Cause Analysis & Backend Fix\n**Duration**: 1 development cycle\n**Objective**: Identify and fix the backend 404 issue\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. **Root cause analysis document**\n   - Backend server status verification\n   - Endpoint registration analysis\n   - Error reproduction and diagnosis\n\n2. **Backend fixes implemented**\n   - Fix endpoint registration if broken\n   - Ensure proper response formatting (no BOM)\n   - Add error handling and logging\n\n3. **Backend verification**\n   - Manual curl testing of endpoint\n   - Response format validation\n   - Error handling testing\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- [ ] `curl http://localhost:8001/api/activity/files` returns 200 OK with valid JSON\n- [ ] No BOM characters in response\n- [ ] Backend logs show proper request handling\n- [ ] Error handling gracefully returns appropriate status codes\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Backend server must be startable\n- Activity tracker database accessible\n- Python dependencies installed\n\n## Milestone 2: Frontend Integration & Testing\n**Duration**: 0.5 development cycles\n**Objective**: Verify frontend integration and complete end-to-end testing\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. **Frontend verification**\n   - Confirm API calls use correct URL\n   - Verify polling logic works correctly\n   - Test error handling in UI\n\n2. **Integration testing**\n   - End-to-end workflow testing\n   - File generation and display verification\n   - Cross-browser compatibility check\n\n3. **Documentation updates**\n   - API endpoint documentation\n   - Troubleshooting guide\n   - Known issues documentation\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- [ ] No 404 errors in browser console for `/api/activity/files`\n- [ ] Generated files appear correctly in UI\n- [ ] Graceful error handling when backend unavailable\n- [ ] All existing functionality preserved\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Milestone 1 completion\n- Frontend development environment\n- Test file generation capability\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk:\n- Backend configuration issues preventing startup\n- Database connectivity problems\n\n### Medium Risk:\n- CORS configuration conflicts\n- Frontend polling logic issues\n\n### Low Risk:\n- Response format inconsistencies\n- Error message display problems\n\n## Rollback Plan\nIf issues arise:\n1. Revert backend changes to last working state\n2. Disable file polling temporarily in frontend\n3. Document known issues for future resolution\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Zero 404 errors on `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n- Files display correctly in UI within 2 seconds of generation\n- No regression in other API endpoints\n- Clean error logs without spam'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01PqVfhFj2iQRfxcUh2Edhxx', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QjF8pM8mRWmL83B1uGQnPQ', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/ui_files_404_fix_requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'UI Files 404 Err