ruption**: Add validation and rollback mechanisms  \n3. **Performance Regression**: Continuous monitoring during development\n4. **Backward Compatibility**: Maintain existing agent definition format\n\n### Mitigation Strategies\n- Incremental implementation with rollback capability\n- Extensive testing at each milestone\n- Performance monitoring throughout development\n- Staged deployment approach\n\n---\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n### User Experience\n- Real-time progress visibility (Milestone 1)\n- Reduced failure rates through recovery (Milestone 2)\n- Improved system performance through optimization (Milestone 3)\n\n### Technical Metrics  \n- Error recovery success rate > 80%\n- Progress update latency < 500ms\n- Token usage optimization > 10% cost reduction\n- Agent success rate improvement > 15%\n\n### Quality Assurance\n- Zero breaking changes to existing functionality\n- 100% test coverage for new features\n- Performance overhead < 5%\n- Documentation completeness score > 95%\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Begin Milestone 1: Progress Streaming implementation\n2. Set up development environment and testing framework\n3. Start with AgentRuntime enhancement for event emission\n4. Implement WebSocket streaming for progress updates'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012XmvY3pMZ2uq3HKQcEbDjN', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025842.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025842.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011BSJpgVDfxbwxE7gL3o18r', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Us